# VPN worker image. The worker must configure network interfaces/routing and the
# legacy direct-Docker-socket deployment remains supported for compatibility.
# Runtime worker capabilities are explicitly dropped and re-added narrowly in
# app.py; the recommended deployment places Docker API access behind the socket
# proxy. Revisit this exception if main/worker images are split in the future.
DS-0002
